@startuml
title Decomposition view with layered overlay — progetto_ing_software_gr10-main-English
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 420
left to right direction
package "Presentation" as e_group_layer_presentation_67387e <<layer>> {
}
note as N_e_group_layer_presentation_67387e #FFFFFF
  **Responsibilities / members**
  - HomePageGUI: application entry point (main) that shows the home page and opens the registration and login windows
  - UserLoginGUI: collects login credentials and hands them to UserLoginController
  - UserRegistrationGUI: collects registration data and submits it through SystemServicesController
  - UserDashboardGUI: role-dependent dashboard that opens the report creation, review and monitoring windows
  - ReportCreationGUI: form where a citizen creates a report
  - SubmittedReportsGUI: lists the reports a citizen submitted and shows their details
  - ReceivedReportsGUI: lists the received reports for an operator, with filters, and opens the note and status-update windows
  - ReportStatusUpdateGUI: lets an operator advance the status of a report
  - InternalNoteGUI: lets an operator add an internal note to a report
  - ActivityMonitoringGUI: lets an operator request activity-trend monitoring results
end note
e_group_layer_presentation_67387e .. N_e_group_layer_presentation_67387e
package "Application" as e_group_layer_application_01b64b <<layer>> {
}
note as N_e_group_layer_application_01b64b #FFFFFF
  **Responsibilities / members**
  - SystemServicesController: facade giving the boundary one entry point; delegates each use case to its use-case controller
  - UserLoginController: validates login data and obtains the user session data from UserService
  - UserRegistrationController: validates registration data and rejects an already registered email before registering the user
  - ReportCreationController: validates report data, checks the user is a citizen and requests report registration
  - ReportReviewController: checks the user role and retrieves submitted (citizen) or received (operator) reports
  - ReportDetailsController: checks access to a report (operator or owning citizen) and retrieves its details and history
  - ReportStatusUpdateController: checks operator privileges, advances the report status and then requests the notification
  - InternalNoteController: checks operator permission and requests registration of an internal note
  - ActivityMonitoringController: authorises the operator, validates criteria and requests monitoring results
  - NotificationController: decides whether a status is notifiable and requests the citizen notification
end note
e_group_layer_application_01b64b .. N_e_group_layer_application_01b64b
package "Domain" as e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd <<layer>> {
}
note as N_e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd #FFFFFF
  **Responsibilities / members**
  - ReportService: domain service for reports: registers reports, retrieves them, updates status, adds notes, generates notifications and monitoring statistics
  - UserService: domain service for users: registers users, looks up credentials and checks citizen/operator roles
  - Report: persistent report: data, location, assigned operator, internal notes, status updates and a status object that drives status changes
  - User: abstract persistent user with name, phone number and credentials (single-table inheritance)
  - Citizen: user who submits reports
  - MunicipalOperator: user who reviews, updates and annotates reports
  - InternalNote: persistent internal note written by an operator on a report
  - StatusUpdate: persistent record of a status change made by an operator
  - Notification: persistent notification sent to a citizen about a report status change
  - ReportCategory: enumerates the categories a report can have
  - ReportStatus: state interface: advances a report and tells whether the status is notifiable
  - Submitted: initial state; advancing makes the report Assigned
  - Assigned: state; advancing makes the report InProgress; notifiable
  - InProgress: state; advancing makes the report Resolved
  - Resolved: final state; refuses further advancement; notifiable
end note
e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd .. N_e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd
package "Persistence" as e_group_layer_persistence_7fe3c4 <<layer>> {
}
note as N_e_group_layer_persistence_7fe3c4 #FFFFFF
  **Responsibilities / members**
  - PersistenceService: generic persistence operations (save, update, findById, findByAttribute, findByFields) run in transactions
  - JpaUtil: singleton that owns the EntityManagerFactory of the persistence unit and creates EntityManagers
  - reports_db: MySQL database that stores users, reports, internal notes, status updates and notifications
end note
